{"data":{"body":"[P2] An interrupted close abandons teardown while continuation registrations remain and skips `checkpointManager.shutdown()`. Queued or running work and delayed backend requests can therefore outlive the invocation cleanup. Drain continuations and shut down the checkpoint manager before restoring or propagating interruption, and add an interrupted-close regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774Tqd","finding_digest":"47161be44c2843f16c2214eca9516c2b482387f83afaa42cd5541c8b65f52dae","finding_id":"arf_v1_i4lbxzcmfbb7c3bcctwksulmfn","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::stopcheckpointcontinuations::interrupted-drain","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::stopcheckpointcontinuations::interrupted-drain","line":774,"observation_digest":"99923c9caf61cbc4d9d50352950f93e8b38936a5cf23f652ea6367d82f95249c","observation_id":"aro_v1_tgjdzhfpmhf4jwovanjjkd4t5c","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:41:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_mzsmprnhrmnxmn3jrnckgktulh","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7a4b81a5e4ac6a6c06c72d0c5634842c67fdbba8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":770,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_3exnrqhwld7tvh4mzr64bzqjfb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:41:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
